msgid "Reduce the width of the cropped image by the specified number of pixels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30122"
msgid "0"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30123"
msgid "Offset horizontally to the right (positive) or left (negative) by the specified number of pixels. May be used to correct alignment issues. Only supported by the software renderer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30124"
msgid "First displayed scan line when running NTSC content. Values greater than zero will reduce the height of output images by cropping pixels from the topmost edge. May be used to counteract letterboxing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30125"
msgid "0 (Default)"
msgstr "0 (по умолчанию)"

msgctxt "#30126"
msgid "Last displayed scan line when running NTSC content. Values less than 239 will reduce the height of output images by cropping pixels from the bottommost edge. May be used to counteract letterboxing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30127"
msgid "239 (Default)"
msgstr "239 (по умолчанию)"

msgctxt "#30128"
msgid "First displayed scan line when running PAL content. Values greater than zero will reduce the height of output images by cropping pixels from the topmost edge. May be used to counteract letterboxing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30129"
msgid "Last displayed scan line when running PAL content. Values below 287 will reduce the height of output images by cropping pixels from the bottommost edge. May be used to counteract letterboxing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30130"
msgid "287 (Default)"
msgstr "287 (по умолчанию)"

msgctxt "#30131"
msgid "PGXP (Precision Geometry Transform Pipeline)"
msgstr "PGXP (конвейер точных геометрических преобразований)"

msgctxt "#30132"
msgid "These options control enhancements which can improve graphics compared to the original console. PGXP can get rid of warping textures and Z-fighting issues."
msgstr "Настройки для повышения качества графики выше уровня оригинальной консоли. PGXP помогает избежать Z-конфликтов и искажений текстур."

msgctxt "#30133"
msgid "Render 3D objects with subpixel precision, minimizing distortion and jitter of 3D objects seen on original hardware due to the usage of fixed point vertex coordinates. 'Memory Only' mode has minimal compatibility issues and is recommended for general use. 'Memory + CPU (Buggy)' mode can reduce jitter even further but has high performance requirements and may cause various geometry errors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30134"
msgid "Memory Only"
msgstr "Только память"

msgctxt "#30135"
msgid "Memory + CPU (Buggy)"
msgstr "Память + CPU (нестабильно)"

msgctxt "#30136"
msgid "Hide more glaring errors in PGXP operations: the value specifies the tolerance in which PGXP values will be kept in case of geometries without proper depth information."
msgstr "Скрывает больше выраженных ошибок в операциях PGXP: настройка устанавливает допустимое отклонение значений PGXP для объектов без точных данных о глубине."

msgctxt "#30137"
msgid "Use PGXP's NCLIP implementation. Improves appearance by reducing holes in geometries with PGXP coordinates. Known to cause some games to lock up in various circumstances."
msgstr "Использовать PGXP-реализацию NCLIP. Улучшает графику за счёт уменьшения провалов в геометрии с помощью PGXP-координат. В некоторых случаях может приводить к зависанию игр."

msgctxt "#30138"
msgid "Replace native PSX affine texture mapping with perspective correct texture mapping. Eliminates position-dependent distortion and warping of textures, resulting in properly aligned textures. This option is applied only when PGXP Operation Mode is enabled. Supported by the hardware renderers and the software renderer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30139"
msgid "On-Screen Display"
msgstr "Индикация на экране"

msgctxt "#30140"
msgid "Change notifications being shown on-screen."
msgstr "Настройка отображаемых на экране уведомлений."

msgctxt "#30141"
msgid "Display the internal frame rate at which the emulated PlayStation system is rendering content. Note: Requires onscreen notifications to be enabled in the libretro frontend."
msgstr "Отображать внутреннюю частоту кадров, с которой эмулируемая PlayStation производит рендеринг. Примечание: требуется включение уведомлений в настройках фронтенда."

msgctxt "#30142"
msgid "Display OSD messages generated by the core."
msgstr "Выводить на экран сообщения, генерируемые ядром."

msgctxt "#30143"
msgid "Input"
msgstr "Устройства ввода"

msgctxt "#30144"
msgid "Change light gun, mouse and neGcon settings."
msgstr "Настройки светового пистолета, мыши и neGcon."

msgctxt "#30145"
msgid "Enable dynamic calibration of analog inputs when the device is set to DualShock, Analog Controller, Analog Joystick, or neGcon. Maximum registered input values are monitored in real time and used to scale analog coordinates passed to the emulator. This should be used for games such as Mega Man Legends 2 that expect larger values than what modern controllers provide. For best results, analog sticks should be rotated at full extent to tune the calibration algorithm each time content is loaded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30146"
msgid "When the input device type is DualShock, this option allows the emulated DualShock to be toggled between DIGITAL and ANALOG mode like original hardware. Mode can also be toggled by using the selected button combination."
msgstr "При выборе устройства ввода типа DualShock данная опция позволяет переключать эмулируемый DualShock между цифровым и аналоговым режимами, как на реальной консоли. Режим также может быть изменён одной из комбинаций кнопок."

msgctxt "#30147"
