msgctxt "#30187"
msgid "Responsiveness of the 'Mouse' input device type."
msgstr "Чувствительность устройства ввода типа 'Мышь'."

msgctxt "#30188"
msgid "Left analog stick response type when simulating the 'twist' action of emulated 'neGcon' input devices. Analog stick displacement may be mapped to neGcon rotation angle either linearly, quadratically or cubically. 'Quadratic' allows for greater precision than 'Linear' when making small movements. 'Cubic' further increases small movement precision, but 'exaggerates' larger movements. Note: 'Linear' is only recommended when using racing wheel peripherals. Conventional controllers implement analog input in a manner fundamentally different from the neGcon 'twist' mechanism, such that linear mapping over-amplifies small movements, impairing fine control. In most cases, 'Quadratic' provides the closest approximation of real hardware."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30189"
msgid "Linear"
msgstr "Линейный"

msgctxt "#30190"
msgid "Quadratic"
msgstr "Квадратичный"

msgctxt "#30191"
msgid "Cubic"
msgstr "Кубический"

msgctxt "#30192"
msgid "Left analog stick deadzone when simulating the 'twist' action of emulated 'neGcon' input devices. Used to eliminate controller drift. Note: Most neGcon-compatible titles provide in-game options for setting a 'twist' deadzone value. To avoid loss of precision, the in-game deadzone should *always* be set to zero. Any required adjustments should *only* be applied via this core option. This is particularly important when 'neGcon Twist Response' is set to 'Quadratic' or 'Cubic'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30193"
msgid "Memory Card"
msgstr "Карты памяти"

msgctxt "#30194"
msgid "Change virtual memory card related settings."
msgstr "Настройка параметров виртуальных карт памяти."

msgctxt "#30195"
msgid "Save data format used for the left memory card slot. 'Mednafen' may be used for compatibility with the stand-alone version of Mednafen. When used with Beetle PSX, Libretro (.srm) and Mednafen (.mcr) saves have internally identical formats and can be converted between one another via renaming. Restart required."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30196"
msgid "Libretro"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30197"
msgid "Mednafen"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30198"
msgid "Emulate a second memory card in the right memory card slot. Note: Some games require this option to be disabled for correct operation (e.g. Codename Tenka). Note: Memory Card Slot 2 uses the Mednafen (.mcr) save format. Restart required."
msgstr "Эмулировать вторую карту памяти в слоте карты памяти справа. Для некоторых игр опция должна быть выключена (напр., Codename Tenka). Примечание: карта памяти в слоте 2 использует формат сохранений Mednafen (.mcr). Требуется перезапуск."

msgctxt "#30199"
msgid "Use shared memory cards instead of separate cards for each content. Note: if 'Memory Card Method' is set to 'Libretro', only memory card slot 2 will be affected. Restart required."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30200"
msgid "Memory card currently loaded in the left slot. This option will only work if Memory Card Method is set to Mednafen."
msgstr "Выбор текущей карты памяти в слоте слева. Данная опция работает только при выборе Mednafen в качестве метода карты памяти."

msgctxt "#30201"
msgid "Memory card currently loaded in the right slot. This option will only work if Memory Card Slot 2 is enabled."
msgstr "Выбор текущей карты памяти в слоте справа. Данная опция работает только при включении слота карты памяти 2."

msgctxt "#30202"
msgid "1 (Default)"
msgstr "1 (по умолчанию)"

msgctxt "#30203"
msgid "Emulation Hacks"
msgstr "Хаки эмуляции"

msgctxt "#30204"
msgid "Change emulation accuracy settings affecting low-level performance and compatibility."
msgstr "Настройка параметров точности эмуляции, влияющих на производительность и совместимость."

msgctxt "#30205"
msgid "Some games (e.g. Doom, Hexen, Soul Blade, etc.) draw horizontal lines by stretching single-pixel-high triangles across the screen, which are rasterized as a row of pixels on original hardware. This hack detects these small triangles and converts them to quads as required, allowing them to be displayed properly on the hardware renderers and at upscaled internal resolutions. 'Aggressive' is required for some titles (e.g. Dark Forces, Duke Nukem) but may otherwise introduce graphical glitches. Leave at 'Default' if unsure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30206"
msgid "Default"
msgstr "По умолчанию"

msgctxt "#30207"
msgid "Aggressive"
msgstr "Агрессивно"

msgctxt "#30208"
msgid "Render 3D content anamorphically and output the emulated framebuffer at a widescreen aspect ratio. Produces best results with fully 3D games. 2D elements will be horizontally stretched and may be misaligned."
msgstr "Анаморфный 3D-рендеринг и вывод фреймбуфера в широкоформатном соотношении сторон. Наилучший результат достигается для игр полностью в 3D. Элементы 2D могут смещаться и будут вытянуты по горизонтали."

msgctxt "#30209"
msgid "Aspect ratio to be used by the Widescreen Mode Hack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30210"
msgid "Skip the per-sample processing of voices whose envelope has fully released. Audio output is identical; the optimization automatically disables itself while the SPU IRQ is in use. Saves roughly 5-10% of frame time. Disable for fully accurate SPU register state."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30211"
msgid "Dynamically recompile CPU instructions to native instructions. Much faster than interpreter, but CPU timing is less accurate, and may have bugs."
msgstr "Динамически преобразовывает инструкции CPU в нативные. Существенно быстрее интерпретатора, но обеспечивает меньшую точность таймингов CPU и может вызывать ошибки."

msgctxt "#30212"
msgid "Disabled (Beetle Interpreter)"
msgstr "Откл. (интерпретатор Beetle)"

msgctxt "#30213"
msgid "Max Performance"
msgstr "Макс. производительность"

msgctxt "#30214"
msgid "Lightrec Interpreter"
msgstr "Интерпретатор Lightrec"

msgctxt "#30215"
msgid "Some games require 'Full' invalidation, some require 'DMA Only'."
msgstr "Для некоторых игр требуется 'Полная' инвалидация, для других 'Только DMA'."

msgctxt "#30216"
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Полная"

msgctxt "#30217"
msgid "DMA Only (Slightly Faster)"
msgstr "Только DMA (немного быстрее)"

msgctxt "#30218"
msgid "Cycles the dynarec charges per CPU instruction. '2' is faster, but the emulated CPU appears half-speed to games that pace themselves against it - set '1' for games whose CD streaming stalls or hangs under the dynarec (e.g. Parasite Eve 2). The '1' setting charges memory accesses two cycles and everything else one, close to the real CPU."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30219"
msgid "2 (Default)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30220"
msgid "1 (Accurate, Fixes Parasite Eve 2 etc.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30221"
msgid "Max cycles run by CPU before a GPU/DMA/MDEC/Timer Update is checked, higher number will be faster, has much less impact on beetle interpreter than dynarec."
msgstr "Макс. циклов, выполняемых процессором до проверки обновления таймеров/GPU/DMA/MDEC. Более высокие значения повышают скорость. Для интерпретатора beetle эффект менее выражен, чем для dynarec."

msgctxt "#30222"
msgid "128 (Default)"
msgstr "128 (по умолчанию)"

msgctxt "#30223"
msgid "Max SPU samples to run before a SPU Update is checked, higher number will be faster, but will cause sound glitches in some games with anything other than 1."
msgstr "Макс. сэмплов, обрабатываемых до проверки обновления SPU. Более высокие значения повышают скорость, но в некоторых играх отклонение от 1 приводит к искажению звука."

msgctxt "#30224"
msgid "Enabled will generate faster code, but potentially crash, by assuming sp and gp registers always point to ram, disabled is more widely compatible"
msgstr ""

